# A [[convulsion]] of the upper [[digestive tract]].
# {{lb|en|archaic}} A mouthful that makes one retch or choke.
#* {{quote-book|en |year=2008|title=The Life, Letters, and Writings of Charles Lamb - Volume 3 |author=Charles Lamb; Percy Fitzgerald |page=153|ISBN=|passage=L. has recorded the repugnance of the school to '''gags''', or the fat of fresh beef boiled, and sets it down to some superstition.}}
